---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="GS1 Digital Link & High-Speed Serialization | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Industrial 2D QR code serialization and GS1 Digital Link resolver pipeline for high-speed battery pack and cell production lines."
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-radial-gradient">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-accent-cyan uppercase tracking-widest bg-accent-cyan/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-accent-cyan/20">
          Serialization & Identification
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mt-4 mb-6">
          High-Speed GS1 Digital Link & QR Serialization
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Article 13 of Regulation (EU) 2023/1542 mandates that every battery pack carry a durable, legible 2D QR code linking to its passport. Our system delivers industrial-grade laser marking integration and global edge-resolved GS1 Digital Link URIs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Features -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 my-16">
        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🏷️</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">GS1 Standard URL Structure</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Standard format: <code class="text-brand-400 bg-slate-950 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">https://id.eudppprovider.com/01/GTIN/21/SERIAL</code>. Automatically resolves to machine-readable JSON-LD or human-friendly web portals based on HTTP Accept headers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">High-Throughput Line Integration</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Direct TCP/IP and OPC-UA connectivity with industrial laser marking and thermal transfer labeling equipment (Keyence, Trumpf, Zebra) at 120+ packs per minute.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🌐</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Sub-50ms Global Resolver CDN</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            High-availability edge routing across European and global POPs guaranteeing instantaneous passport loading for European customs inspectors and end consumers.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Connect Your Manufacturing Lines</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Review our industrial serialization API guides and hardware compatibility matrix.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-brand-500 text-white font-bold text-sm hover:opacity-90">
          Talk to a Serialization Specialist &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
